      "headline": "ANIF Concludes Cybersecurity Training, Bolstering Anti-Money Laundering Efforts",
      "dek": "Equatorial Guinea's financial intelligence agency, ANIF, has completed technical training with Guatemalan experts, focusing on cybersecurity and anti-money laundering measures.",
